--
^warning: ignoring
--
Assertion fails because function return values are nondet when the
function body has already been converted but the call-site doesn't
inline the result. Symbolic execution should handle this, but our
model may lose precision through type mismatches or missing return
value propagation. Affects ~289 ESBMC tests.
